# Finance Hub — Chinese wall (non-negotiable)

This app is **information only** until Chris **explicitly** authorizes trading in writing.

## Allowed

- Schwab read/sync (quotes, positions, greeks, balances, TRADE history)
- Analytics, alerts, reports, situation linking, local reclassify
- Flag undefined-risk shorts (naked calls / strangles = unbounded)

## Forbidden

- Broker order placement, tickets, submit/cancel/replace
- Any path that moves capital via Schwab (or other brokers)
- Setting `FINANCE_HUB_ALLOW_BROKER_ORDERS` unless Chris asked

`src/lib/schwab/client.ts` refuses trader paths that look like `/orders` or `/previewOrder` unless that flag is `"1"`. Do not add UI that calls those paths.

## Style notes

LEAPs vs ~15Δ short naked strangles / premium selling. Prefer analytics over action.

